{{DISPLAYTITLE:#01 Ghost Panic}}
'''#01 Ghost Panic''' (#01 ゴーストパニック, ''#01 Gōsuto Panikku'', '''#01 Ghost Panic''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that was added in [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]]. Like all [[Gauntlet]]s, progress made in #01 Ghost Panic will reset when the event ends. The bosses of this Gauntlet are many common enemies that the player encounters during main progress.

==Overview==
===About===
<nowiki>#</nowiki>01 Ghost Panic contains a total of 10 stages. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for each stage completion are Legend Souls.

