==Trivia==
*During the initial run of this event in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]], it, the [[Halloween Party! (Event Gacha)|Halloween Party! Event Gacha]] and its associated login stamps were all temporarily canceled due to a bug involving the Event Gacha's drops.
*The first two stages bases being the one used in [[New York (Empire of Cats)|New York]] could be a reference to how most of the ''[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ghostbusters Ghostbusters]'' films take place in New York City.

